msgid "Captcha could not load. Please refresh and try again."
msgstr "Le captcha n’a pas pu se charger. Actualisez la page et réessayez."

#: front/components/pages/onboarding/VerifyPage.tsx
msgid "Verify your phone"
msgstr "Vérifiez votre téléphone"

#: front/components/pages/onboarding/VerifyPage.tsx
msgid "We verify your number once to keep free credits fair. We won't text you otherwise."
